x53 text ".reveal.in .col.view{animation:c1 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in .col.model{animation:c2 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in .col.asm{animation:c3 9600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v0 .ty{animation:v0 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v0::after{animation:v0c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v1 .ty{animation:v1 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v1::after{animation:v1c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v2 .ty{animation:v2 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v2::after{animation:v2c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v3 .ty{animation:v3 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v3::after{animation:v3c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v4 .ty{animation:v4 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v4::after{animation:v4c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n.reveal.in #v5 .ty{animation:v5 9600ms linear infinite}.reveal.in #v5::after{animation:v5c 9600ms steps(1,end) infinite}\n"
